    "It's taken out of the note, and its file goes to Marrow's trash, where you can restore it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's taken out of the note, and its file goes to Marrow's trash, where you can restore it."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "এটি নোট থেকে সরানো হবে, আর এর ফাইলটি ম্যারোর ট্র্যাশে যাবে; সেখান থেকে ফিরিয়ে আনা যায়।"
