    "When a note changes on two devices before they sync, a sync app may keep both as a copy. Merge puts the copy's changes into the note and moves the copy to the trash.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a note changes on two devices before they sync, a sync app may keep both as a copy. Merge puts the copy's changes into the note and moves the copy to the trash."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "সিঙ্কের আগেই দুই ডিভাইসে নোট বদলালে সিঙ্ক অ্যাপ দুটোকেই কপি হিসেবে রাখতে পারে। একত্র করলে কপির বদলগুলো নোটে যায় আর কপিটি ট্র্যাশে যায়।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
